        "圖形是水平線，到處的斜率都是 $0$",
        "$f(x)=x$：",
        "直覺：導數是斜率，直線的斜率到處一樣"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "f'(x)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}",
        "\\frac{d}{dx}\\,c=0",
        "\\frac{(x+h)-x}{h}=\\frac hh=1",
        "\\frac{d}{dx}\\,x=1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 冪次法則",
      "body": [
        "用定義算過的幾個：",
        "看出規律：次方掉下來當係數，次方減 1",
        "對任何實數 $n$ 都成立（$x$ 在定義域內）；正整數的證明在 ⑤，一般的 $n$ 留到「對數微分法」",
        "例：",
        "也可以用上一課「有理化」的方法直接驗證 $(\\sqrt x)'=\\frac1{2\\sqrt x}$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\frac{d}{dx}x^2=2x,\\qquad \\frac{d}{dx}x^3=3x^2",
        "\\frac{d}{dx}x^n=nx^{n-1}",
        "\\frac{d}{dx}x^{7}=7x^{6},\\qquad\\frac{d}{dx}x^{-1}=-x^{-2}",
        "\\frac{d}{dx}x^{1/2}=\\frac12x^{-1/2}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt x}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 試一題",
      "body": [
        "求出 $\\dfrac23x^{-1/3}$，再代 $x=8$：$8^{-1/3}=\\dfrac12$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 線性：常數倍與加減",
      "body": [
        "為什麼？寫出差商：",
        "常數倍一樣：$\\frac{cf(x+h)-cf(x)}{h}=c\\cdot\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}$",
        "兩塊的極限都存在，用極限的加法定律：$\\to f'(x)+g'(x)$",
        "例：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\big(x^5-3x^2+7\\big)$",
        "一項一項微：",
        "例：$x=1$ 的切線斜率 $=5-6=-1$",
        "多項式：每一項都只用冪次法則"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\big(c\\,f(x)\\big)'=c\\,f'(x)",
        "\\big(f(x)\\pm g(x)\\big)'=f'(x)\\pm g'(x)",
        "\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{(f+g)(x+h)-(f+g)(x)}{h}\\\\&=\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}+\\frac{g(x+h)-g(x)}{h}\\end{aligned}",
        "=5x^4-3\\cdot2x+0",
        "=5x^4-6x"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 小心：沒有「乘法版」",
      "body": [
        "反例：$x\\cdot x=x^2$，導數是 $2x$",
        "若把兩個 $x$ 各自微：$1\\cdot1=1\\ne2x$",
        "乘、除的規則在下一個單元（乘法法則、除法法則）"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\big(f\\cdot g\\big)'\\ne f'\\cdot g'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 先改寫成次方",
      "body": [
        "看到分式、根號：先改寫成 $x^n$ 的和",
        "例：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\Big(\\dfrac{2}{x^3}+4\\sqrt x\\Big)$",
        "改寫：$2x^{-3}+4x^{1/2}$",
        "常見錯誤：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\dfrac{2}{x^3}\\ne\\dfrac{2}{3x^2}$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\frac1{x^n}=x^{-n},\\qquad\\sqrt[m]{x^k}=x^{k/m}",
        "\\frac{d}{dx}=2(-3)x^{-4}+4\\cdot\\frac12x^{-1/2}",
        "=-\\frac{6}{x^4}+\\frac{2}{\\sqrt x}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 先約分，再求切線",
      "body": [
        "$f(x)=\\dfrac{x^2+1}{x}$，求 $f'(2)$",
        "分子每一項除以 $x$：",
        "切點：$f(2)=\\dfrac{4+1}{2}=\\dfrac52$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "f(x)=\\frac{x^2}{x}+\\frac1x=x+x^{-1}",
        "f'(x)=1-x^{-2}=1-\\frac1{x^2}",
        "f'(2)=1-\\frac14=\\frac34",
        "y-\\frac52=\\frac34(x-2)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=\\frac34x+1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "⑤ 證明（正整數 $n$）",
      "body": [
        "要證：$n$ 是正整數時，$\\dfrac{d}{dx}x^n=nx^{n-1}$",
        "二項式展開：",
        "相減，$x^n$ 消掉：",
        "除以 $h$（$h\\ne0$）：",
        "$h\\to0$：後面每一項都 $\\to0$",
        "項數是固定的 $n$ 項，所以可以逐項取極限",
        "負整數、分數次方：之後用除法法則、隱函數微分補證"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\begin{aligned}(x+h)^n=\\;&x^n+nx^{n-1}h\\\\&+\\tbinom n2x^{n-2}h^2+\\cdots+h^n\\end{aligned}",
        "\\begin{aligned}(x+h)^n-x^n=\\;&nx^{n-1}h\\\\&+\\tbinom n2x^{n-2}h^2+\\cdots+h^n\\end{aligned}",
        "\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x+h)^n-x^n}{h}=\\;&nx^{n-1}\\\\&+\\tbinom n2x^{n-2}h+\\cdots+h^{n-1}\\end{aligned}",
        "\\frac{d}{dx}x^n=nx^{n-1}\\qquad\\blacksquare"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "重點整理",
      "body": [
        "• $(c)'=0$，$(x)'=1$",
        "• 冪次法則：$(x^n)'=nx^{n-1}$，負數、分數次方都能用",
        "• 線性：常數倍提出來，加減逐項微",
        "• 乘法不能逐項微：$(fg)'\\ne f'g'$",
        "• 分式、根號：先改寫成次方，再微",
        "• 證明：二項式展開，帶 $h$ 的項都消失",
        "下一課：三角函數微分"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "workedExamples": [
    {
      "title": "多項式逐項微分",
      "prompt": "$\\frac{d}{dx} (x^5 - 3x^2 + 7)$",
      "problemId": "der-001",
      "steps": [
        "加減逐項：$x^5$、$-3x^2$、7 各自微分。",
        "$(x^5)' = 5x^4$。",
        "$(-3x^2)' = -3 \\cdot 2x = -6x$（常數倍留著）。",
        "$(7)' = 0$。合起來 $5x^4 - 6x$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$5x^4 - 6x$",
      "claim": "D(x^5-3x^2+7) == 5x^4-6x"
    },
    {
      "title": "負次方與分數次方",
      "prompt": "$\\frac{d}{dx} (\\frac{2}{x^3} + 4\\sqrt{x})$",
      "steps": [
        "改寫：$\\frac{2}{x^3} = 2x^{-3}$，$4\\sqrt{x} = 4x^{1/2}$。",
        "$(2x^{-3})' = 2 \\cdot (-3)x^{-4} = -6x^{-4}$。次方是 $-3 - 1 = -4$，不是 $-2$。",
        "$(4x^{1/2})' = 4 \\cdot \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)x^{-1/2} = 2x^{-1/2}$。",
        "寫回分式：$-\\frac{6}{x^4} + \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{x}}$（$x > 0$）。"
      ],
      "answer": "$-\\frac{6}{x^4} + \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{x}}$",
      "claim": "D(2/x^3+4*sqrt(x)) == -6/x^4+2/sqrt(x)"
    },
    {
      "title": "先約分，再求切線斜率",
      "prompt": "$f(x) = \\frac{x^2 + 1}{x}$，求 $f'(2)$。",
      "steps": [
        "分子分母不能各自微分。先拆開：$\\frac{x^2 + 1}{x} = x + \\frac{1}{x} = x + x^{-1}$。",
        "$f'(x) = 1 + (-1)x^{-2} = 1 - \\frac{1}{x^2}$。",
        "$f'(2) = 1 - \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{3}{4}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{3}{4}$",
      "claim": "D((x^2+1)/x, 2) == 3/4 ;; D(x+1/x) == 1-1/x^2"
    }
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "$\\left(\\frac{1}{x^3}\\right)'$ 寫成 $\\frac{1}{3x^2}$：要先改成 $x^{-3}$，得 $-3x^{-4}$。",
    "負次方減 1 往錯的方向：$x^{-3}$ 的次方減 1 是 $-4$。",
    "常數的導數寫成常數本身，例如 $(7)' = 7$、$(\\pi^2)' = 2\\pi$。",
    "分式的分子分母各自微分：$\\left(\\frac{x^2 + 1}{x}\\right)'$ 寫成 $\\frac{2x}{1}$。",
    "$\\sqrt{x}$ 微分成 $\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{2}$ 或 $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}$，漏了 $\\frac{1}{2}$ 或次方減 1。"
  ],
